WEBVTT

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:04.811
Lyn Slater: I'm not
a Pollyanna about aging.

00:18:04.835 --> 00:18:07.585
There's certainly changes in my body.

00:18:07.609 --> 00:18:10.959
You know, I have my wrinkles,
I have my white hair,

00:18:10.983 --> 00:18:15.435
but I think that I could generate content

00:18:15.459 --> 00:18:18.827
as much as someone who's younger than me.

00:18:18.851 --> 00:18:24.422
In fact, most of the peers
who are at my level

00:18:24.446 --> 00:18:26.308
are all younger than me.

00:18:26.853 --> 00:18:28.895
AG: Lyn Slater is 65.

00:18:29.315 --> 00:18:31.399
She recently quit her career
as a professor